The content-ID, signature and chapter shuffle protocol in client/wr_protocol.c
and the endpoint/request conventions in client/wr_client.c are adapted from
epdiy-epub/src/weread (the supplied epdiy-epub source archive).
The archive's root license is reproduced below.

