client/private/wr_cjson.[ch] derives from cJSON 1.7.17, retaining the Dave Gamble
and cJSON contributors MIT notice in both files. Local changes namespace all
cJSON symbols, use fixed epd_app_alloc/free callbacks, remove the mutable hook
API and RT-Thread calls, reject embedded NUL/control bytes in strings, and
limit JSON nesting to 64 levels.

client/private/wr_md5.[ch] and wr_base64.[ch] are private copies of
SiFli-SDK/external/mbedtls/library/{md5,base64}.c and their matching headers.
Their ARM Limited copyright and Apache-2.0 notices are retained. Local changes
prefix symbols/configuration macros and select wr_crypto_config.h. The Apache
license is reproduced in client/private/LICENSE.mbedtls.
